BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:c6ce8cdf4a574ba98370acc9@greenville-kid-calendar
DTSTAMP:20260923T150014Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T090000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20261003T190000
SUMMARY:Kidtoberfest: Fall Family Festival
LOCATION:TCMU Greenville\, 300 College St\, Greenville\, SC\, 29601
DESCRIPTION:Kidtoberfest is a special fundraising event that supports The C
 hildren’s Museum of the Upstate’s mission to provide intentional and i
 nclusive play experiences for families across our community. Explore fall-
 themed activities throughout the museum Enjoy complimentary face painting 
 Treat yourself to seasonal goodies Enjoy The Steubenville Tootlers oompah 
 band from 9am – 11am Grab a bite from local food trucks Play in three fl
 oors of museum exhibits Visit the inaugural TCMU Biergarten from 4pm – 7
 pm As this is a fundraiser for the museum\, all guests\, including members
 \, must purchase a ticket to attend. Source: The Children's Museum of the 
 Upstate. Check the linked organizer page before leaving.
URL:https://tcmupstate.org/event/kidtoberfest/
END:VEVENT
